        "basis": "Official manufacturer classification of the BAPbase brand (Bapco / BLBOC), corroborated grade by grade by a distributor table",
        "notes": "The supplied DL2-12888.jfif does not state the API Group. Bapco (cited page): 'Branded globally as BAPbase, our Group III Lubricant Base Oils ... Our BAPbase grades are produced by our affiliate, the Bahrain Lube Base Oil Company (BLBOC)'. Bapco's BLBOC page (https://www.bapco.net/ar/default.asp?action=article&id=34) describes the BLBOC plant as 'manufacturing Group III base oils' with a capacity of '400,000 tonnes a year of Very High Viscosity Index (VHVI), Group III Base Oils'. The manufacturer therefore classifies the whole BAPbase brand, and the plant that makes every grade, as Group III. Grade-level corroboration (distributor): MOGO 2025 Base Oils flyer (https://specs.ergonspecialtyoils.com/mogoil/MOGO-2025_Base%20Oils_Flyer_a4_Digital.pdf) p.4 lists BAPbase 6 in its 'Group III' table. Web page, no page number (2026-10 audit).",
